    'so on, each in the IfcBuildingStorey its height puts it in, in metres; export_ifc() does that '
    'one from here, reports the path and how many elements of each class came out, and takes about '
    'ten seconds. Everything downloads AND keeps a copy under data/architecture/exports/. The icons '
